WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.667
A failed run. Open it.

2
00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:09.606
One sentence says where it broke.

3
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:13.877
Spend after the first error, counted.

4
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.213
The red line is the first error.

5
00:00:17.981 --> 00:00:20.982
Press e. The failed tool call opens.

6
00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:24.581
What went wrong, from the event itself.

7
00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:28.625
Every model call carries tokens and cost.

8
00:00:28.891 --> 00:00:31.825
Retries are retries, not log lines.

9
00:00:33.128 --> 00:00:36.328
Findings, from deterministic detectors.

10
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:39.511
Each finding links to its evidence.

11
00:00:40.862 --> 00:00:43.730
Five agents, one run, one picture.

12
00:00:44.214 --> 00:00:47.213
The thick edge is the critical path.

13
00:00:48.564 --> 00:00:51.431
The agent asked. A person decides.

14
00:00:51.765 --> 00:00:54.430
One approval, one action, once.

15
00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:58.254
What the week cost, per run.

16
00:00:58.537 --> 00:01:01.871
Failed runs, retries, spend after errors.

17
00:01:03.224 --> 00:01:06.891
Destructive commands, secret reads, risky git.

18
00:01:07.174 --> 00:01:09.774
Every finding states its rule.
